{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Seed World</u></strong> is a game that aims to combine automation, conveyor belts, and level challenges. The game simplifies 'building' automation into progress bars. Each progress generates or consumes resources, and players need to manage resources wisely, avoiding blindly activating items to prevent resource shortages that could interrupt the cycle. This could put players in the midst of battle at a dangerous disadvantage!<br><br>Can anyone understand me? Watching dozens of progress bars move rapidly is really stress-relieving 0v0.<br><br>The game is themed around food and summer. Players control characters to obtain money, gems, food, and other resources while fighting enemies, using various summer delicacies to repel those annoying foes.<br><br>The protagonist has an ice cream sword that can protect them in close combat. Although it can become very powerful later in the game, it should not be relied upon in the early stages!<br><br>As long as players can plan resource consumption properly, every battle becomes a major improvement.<br><br>Bosses carry powerful relics, and each boss has very special combat styles and characteristics, so never underestimate them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&quot;Hunter&quot;:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a relatively small, casual roguelike shooting game. The protagonist fights using revolvers with different functions, with a dozen types of bullets. Should you use the highly damaging armor-piercing bullets, or the fiery bullets that can burn enemies? These can all be controlled by obtaining items. Whether you want extreme single-target damage or chaotic damage with special effects, it\u2019s all in the player's hands.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u94b1\u591a\u591a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/b27ada50c0e306fc1913c1a91033275f6c5da047.jpg"},{"name":"\u8c6a\u6c14\u51b2\u5929","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/02af4051030c24e9198131f1ebd103c972e1575f.jpg"},{"name":"\u5bcc\u53ef\u654c\u56fd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/ed770fa429e24874fafa6e407503a2e9c73607a0.jpg"},{"name":"\u950b\u8292\u521d\u9732","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/523d2152b61d46560e10080507e0e5f8c14c1a13.jpg"},{"name":"\u804c\u4e1a\u6740\u624b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/7b5bc3a0a72c5286431d0e34bf1ae2545951a932.jpg"},{"name":"\u65e0\u654c\u751f\u8fd8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768080/c734f8f7a7f5617b07775beb31a8de59955fd2f7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768080?t=1773167629","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/6ca7b853d9b932c0c7891f97efcf3f579b7617a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773167629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/fb7ce75c2219e06ed95affa16e011998a29c374f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773167629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768080/fb7ce75c2219e06ed95affa16e011998a29c374f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773167629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"descr